{"id": "21908", "title": "周书", "author": "令狐德棻", "category": "文学名著", "count": 52, "available": 52, "cover": "files/article/image/21/21908/21908s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/21/21908.htm", "intro": "周书\r\n　　北魏分裂后，一部分鲜卑贵族在长安（今陕西西安）建立了政权，史称西魏（535—557），与它并立的是东魏政权（534—550）。后来，西魏的鲜卑族宇文氏贵族夺取了拓跋氏的皇位，建周皇朝，史称北周（557—581）。专记西魏、北周史事的“正史”是《周书》。", "base": "files/article/html/21/21908", "chapters": [{"title": "卷一 帝纪第一", "file": "1622472.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二 帝纪第二", "file": "1622473.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷三 帝纪第三", "file": "1622474.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷四 帝纪第四", "file": "1622475.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷五 帝纪第五", "file": "1622476.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷六 帝纪第六", "file": "1622477.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷七 帝纪第七", "file": "1622478.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷八 帝纪第八", "file": "1622479.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷九 列传第一", "file": "1622480.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十 列传第二", "file": "1622481.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十一 列传第三", "file": "1656906.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十二 列传第四", "file": "1656907.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十三 列传第五", "file": "1656908.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十四 列传第六", "file": "1656909.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十五 列传第七", "file": "1656910.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十六 列传第八", "file": "1656911.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十七 列传第九", "file": "1656912.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十八 列传第十", "file": "1656913.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十九 列传第十一", "file": "1656914.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十 列传第十二", "file": "1656915.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十一 列传第十三", "file": "1656916.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十二 列传第十四", "file": "1656917.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十三 列传第十五", "file": "1656918.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十四 列传第十六", "file": "1656919.html", "available": true}, {"ti